achine"},{"area":null,"id":"TheoryOfComputation/np-completeness/cook-levin/cook-levin-sat-np-complete","kind":"node","lean":"MetaMathlibExt.cook_levin_SAT_np_complete","status":"can_prove","summary":"Let SAT be the decision problem on bitstrings that accepts exactly the encodings of satisfiable CNF formulas. Then SAT belongs to NP, and every decision problem $L$ in NP is polynomial-time many-one reducible to SAT: there is a function $f$ from bitstrings to bitstrings, computable in polynomial time, such that $L(x) = \\mathrm{SAT}(f(x))$ for every bitstring $x$.","title":"Cook–Levin theorem: SAT is NP-complete"},{"area":null,"id":"scope:TheoryOfComputation/np-completeness/cook-levin/cook-levin-situation-tables-of-a-multi-stack-mac","kind":"scope","lean":null,"status":"fully_proved","summary":null,"title":"Cook-Levin: situation tables of a multi-stack machine and the correctness of the formula"},{"area":null,"id":"scope:TheoryOfComputation/np-completeness/cook-levin/cook-levin-the-cell-one-hot-family","kind":"scope","lean":null,"status":"fully_proved","summary":null,"title":"Cook-Levin: the cell one-hot family"},{"area":null,"id":"scope:TheoryOfComputation/np-completeness/cook-levin/cook-levin-the-counter-machine-view-shared-by-th","kind":"scope","lean":null,"status":"fully_proved","summary":null,"title":"Cook-Levin: the counter-machine view shared by the clause generators"},{"area":null,"id":"scope:TheoryOfComputation/np-completeness/cook-levin/cook-levin-the-five-generators-as-sub-machines-o","kind":"scope","lean":null,"status":"fully_proved","summary":null,"title":"Cook-Levin: the five generators as sub-machines of one host"},{"area":null,"id":"scope:TheoryOfComputation/np-completeness/cook-levin/cook-levin-the-precomputation-composed-with-the","kind":"scope","lean":null,"status":"fully_proved","summary":null,"title":"Cook-Levin: the precomputation, composed with the assembled generator"},{"area":null,"id":"scope:TheoryOfComputation/np-completeness/cook-levin/dense-